              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "There was a conversation about the effectiveness of two different sets of creatives, with one set explicitly mentioning investment and generating fewer but higher-quality leads, while the other set generated more leads but with less relevance.",
